BASICShell/.build
BASICStudio/.build
BASICStudio/.xcode-derived
BASICStudio/Build/Intermediates.noindex/BASICCore.build
BASICStudio/Build/Intermediates.noindex/BASICStudio.build/Debug/BASICStudio.build
BASICStudio/Build/Intermediates.noindex/SwiftTerm.build
BASICStudio/Build
